      "reviewed_at": "2026-08-07",
      "deferred": [
        "AC-5, physical unplug mid-transfer: never performed. The software half is proven by a_failed_transfer_reports_uncertain_and_forgets_the_picture, a_forgotten_panel_is_written_again_rather_than_deduplicated and a_panel_that_refuses_every_frame_is_reported_rather_than_retried. The observation belongs to US-019, which owns hotplug detection for both devices, exactly as PRD 1.3 already ruled for the lighting equivalent. DisplayExecutor::forget and LcdLink::unprime are the seams it calls and have no production caller until then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "US-017",
      "title": "Build the LCD editor, preview and static output",
      "epic": "EP-004",
      "status": "DONE",
      "priority": "P0",
      "size": "L",
      "blocked_by": [
        "US-004",
