      ],
      "started_at": "2026-08-07",
      "completed_at": "2026-08-07",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-08-07",
      "review_note": "One blocking defect found and fixed on 2026-08-07. The display-mode select mutated the editor without re-deriving the preview, so the preview kept drawing the previous mode while Apply would have sent the new one (AC-2). The editor and its preview are now one DisplayScreen whose private field leaves edit() as the only mutator, pinned by every_editor_change_moves_the_preview_with_it.",
      "deferred": [
        "The PRD's UI gate matrix: Wayland and X11, 920x640 and 1280x720, 100% and 200% scale, and a keyboard-only walkthrough. Four captures are committed and the 920x640 clipping defect was found by running at that size, so the screen has been exercised, but docs/ep-004-evidence.md names neither the display server, nor the scale, nor the walkthrough. Folded into the display polish iteration of the PRD."
      ]
    },
